5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,630
Un cliente lo señaló.

6
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:17,710
Corrigieron.

7
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,700
Lo que pide el punto, revisar la lista

8
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,830
